{"nodes":[{"id":"adb1c1d1e1f1d001","type":"text","text":"# Linux DNS 服务器\n\n**模块说明**：DNS 协议 + BIND 9 + 正反向 + 主从 + 子域委派 + 转发\n\n— 1 个笔记 —","x":-110,"y":-280,"width":280,"height":80,"color":"5"},{"id":"adb1c1d1e1f1d002","type":"file","file":"LinuxDNS.md","x":-130,"y":-100,"width":260,"height":50},{"id":"adb1c1d1e1f1d003","type":"text","text":"LinuxDNS.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型\n• §1 DNS 是什么\n• §2 递归 vs 迭代\n• §3 资源记录 RR\n• §4 BIND 安装\n• §5 named.conf\n• §6 ACL + listen-on\n• §7 正向 zone\n• §8 反向 zone\n• §9 named-checkzone\n• §10 启动 + 防火墙\n• §11 客户端测试\n• §12 Unbound 缓存\n• §13 Dnsmasq\n• §14 nsswitch.conf\n• §15 dig/host/nslookup\n• §16 dig +trace + 状态码\n• §17 子域委派 + 通配符\n• §18 CNAME 陷阱\n• §19 主从/委派/视图\n• §20 安全：TSIG/DNSSEC\n• §21 速查表\n• §22 易错点 ×12\n• §23 面试 8 大追问\n• §24 跨模块链接","x":200,"y":-280,"width":380,"height":600}],"edges":[{"id":"edb1c1d1e1f1d001","fromNode":"adb1c1d1e1f1d001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"adb1c1d1e1f1d002","toSide":"top"},{"id":"edb1c1d1e1f1d002","fromNode":"adb1c1d1e1f1d002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"adb1c1d1e1f1d003","toSide":"left"}]}